        "Same-session naturally captured sanitized snapshot readiness remains required before the single UI submission. No synthetic snapshot or readiness bypass is added.",
        "Paid submission remains a single click, without a retry path.",
        "Existing page/browser/context cleanup and session logout behavior remain; a new init-script failure regression exercises cleanup before page creation or click.",
        "Local readiness retains unknown upload acknowledgement and does not establish backend ingestion, playback or trace-to-Replay correlation."
      ]
